#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:4
msgid "v4.5.8"
msgstr "v4.5.8"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.5.8 is a small release: uint16 model-output support and a MicroSpeech "
"fix. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v4.5.7 scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v4.5.8 je malo izdanje: podrška za uint16 izlaze modela i ispravak za "
"MicroSpeech. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost** — skripte iz v4.5.7 rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:12
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:15
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:17
msgid ""
"**uint16 model outputs** — :class:`ml.Model` now matches ``uint16`` "
"ndarrays."
msgstr ""
"**uint16 izlazi modela** — :class:`ml.Model` sada podudara ``uint16`` "
"ndarrayeve."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:19
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v4.5.7 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flashajte "
"i vaše skripte iz v4.5.7 rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:22
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:24
msgid ""
":class:`ml.Model` — added ``uint16`` support so model output tensors that "
"use ``uint16`` are matched/handled correctly."
msgstr ""
":class:`ml.Model` — dodana podrška za ``uint16`` tako da se izlazni tenzori "
"modela koji koriste ``uint16`` ispravno podudaraju/obrađuju."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:28
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci pogrešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:30
msgid ""
"Fixed :mod:`ml.apps` ``MicroSpeech.listen()`` missing its ``return``, so the"
" detected result is now actually returned to the caller."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno da je :mod:`ml.apps` ``MicroSpeech.listen()`` nedostajao njegov "
"``return``\\ , tako da se otkriveni rezultat sada zaista vraća pozivatelju."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:34
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.8.rst:36
msgid ""
"v4.5.8 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v4.5.7 run unchanged on v4.5.8 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v4.5.8 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v4.5.7 rade nepromijenjeno na"
" v4.5.8 — samo ponovno flashajte ugrađeni program (firmware)."
